
.TH Annotations_impl 3 "" "Odoc" "OCaml Library"
.SH Name
Annotations_impl
.SH Synopsis
.sp 
.in 2
\fBModule Annotations_impl\fR
.in 
.sp 
.SH Documentation
.sp 
.nf 
\f[CB]type\fR refcounted = {
.br 
.ti +2
\f[CB]mutable\fR readers : int [@atomic];
.br 
}
.sp 
\f[CB]exception\fR \f[CB]Atomic_exn\fR \f[CB]of\fR {
.br 
.ti +2
\f[CB]mutable\fR value : int [@atomic];
.br 
}
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
This exception has a record with an atomic annotation that should appear
.nf 
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR with_annot = 
.br 
.ti +2
| \f[CB]Atomic_constr\fR \f[CB]of\fR {
.br 
.ti +6
\f[CB]mutable\fR value : int [@atomic];
.br 
.ti +4
}
.br 
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
The annotation should appear on anonymous records in constructors as well
.nf 

